    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to 172 Rath Lodge. A bright and well presented two-bedroom terraced home in the popular Rath Lodge Estate, Ashbourne, Co. Meath.\n\nThis attractive property offers well proportioned accommodation throughout and provides an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike.\n\nOn entering, the property benefits from a bright and spacious living room, featuring attractive laminate flooring, a feature fireplace and a staircase leading to the first floor. The room provides a comfortable and versatile space for both relaxing and entertaining.\n\nThe kitchen is well positioned and offers access to the rear of the property, providing a practical layout for everyday living.\n\nUpstairs, there are two double bedrooms, along with a family bathroom. The bedrooms are bright and comfortable, with the added benefit of excellent built-in storage.\n\nThe property has been freshly painted throughout and offers the opportunity for a new owner to add their own style and finishing touches. \n\nOutside, the rear garden provides a private outdoor space, fully paved with timber fencing offering a low maintence private retreat.\n\nWe expect strong interest from the outset and we recommend arranging an early viewing. \n\nFor transparency purposes, all bidding will be carried out online via our unique bidding platform \"MySherryFitz\" Here you can register your interest, make offers and request an appointment. Viewing is strictly by appointment only.\n\nSome images are created for illustrative purposes only"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nBright space with low maintenance tiled floor\n\nGuest WC - \nTiled floor, wc, whb , window for natural light\n\nLiving Room - \nLaminate wood floor, freshly painted walls, fireplace with Gas insert\n\nKitchen - \nFitted with base and eye level storage cupboards, tiled flooring, plumbed for washing machine, extractor hood, space for fridge, recessed lighting finishes this room\n\nMain Bathroom - \nRoof Light, shower over bath, extractor fan, this room is fully tiled\n\nAiring Cupboard - \nLarge airing cupboard with shelving for storage, insulated tank and dual immersion installed\n\nBedroom 1 - \nThis double bedroom has carpet underfoot, built in wardrobe and freshly painted walls\n\nBedroom 2 - \nThis double bedroom also has carpet underfoot, freshly painted walls and built in wardrobes\n\nExterior - \nMaintenance free paved rear garden, with raised bedding and timber fence panels for privacy\n\nIncluded in the sale - \nAppliances as seen, fixtures and fittings\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Superb location</li><li>Freshly painted throughout</li><li>Walking distance local bus stops</li><li>Creche on site a short stroll away</li><li>Short walk to Ashbourne town centre, school campus at Millbourne, GAA grounds and clubhouse</li><li>Private rear gardens</li><li>Both bedrooms are double in size</li><li>Mains Services, GFCH</ul>"
      },
